{"case_id": "M1", "source": "synthetic_design_example", "started_at": "2026-11-09T10:00:00+08:00", "segments": [{"id": "M1.1", "start_ms": 12000, "end_ms": 16500, "speaker": "王宁", "text": "登录失败的三个案例，谁来整理发到研发群？", "speaker_name": "王宁", "person_ref": "host"}, {"id": "M1.2", "start_ms": 17000, "end_ms": 21100, "speaker": "说话人 2", "text": "我来，这周五下班前发群里。", "speaker_name": "陈可", "person_ref": "chen"}, {"id": "M1.3", "start_ms": 24000, "end_ms": 28100, "speaker": "王宁", "text": "上线后要不要再做个监控面板？先放着，今天不定。", "speaker_name": "王宁", "person_ref": "host"}, {"id": "M1.4", "start_ms": 30000, "end_ms": 34500, "speaker": "王宁", "text": "这次登录改版的灰度范围定了，第一批只对内部员工开放。", "speaker_name": "王宁", "person_ref": "host"}]}
{"case_id": "M2", "source": "synthetic_design_example", "started_at": "2026-11-16T10:00:00+08:00", "segments": [{"id": "M2.1", "start_ms": 10000, "end_ms": 14600, "speaker": "陈可", "text": "上周说的三个登录失败案例，今天早上我已经发到研发群了。", "speaker_name": "陈可", "person_ref": "chen"}, {"id": "M2.2", "start_ms": 20000, "end_ms": 26500, "speaker": "王宁", "text": "登录改版第一批的范围今天改一下，内部员工和试点客户都开放。", "speaker_name": "王宁", "person_ref": "host"}]}
{"case_id": "M3", "source": "synthetic_design_example", "started_at": "2026-11-09T11:00:00+08:00", "segments": [{"id": "M3.1", "start_ms": 12000, "end_ms": 16300, "speaker": "陈可", "speaker_name": "陈可", "person_ref": "chen", "text": "王宁，周三把验收清单发到项目群，你来负责可以吗？"}, {"id": "M3.2", "start_ms": 16600, "end_ms": 18700, "speaker": "王宁", "speaker_name": "王宁", "person_ref": "host", "text": "可以，我来发。"}]}
{"case_id": "V65", "source": "vcsum_dev_excerpt", "started_at": null, "segments": [{"id": "V65.1", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "2", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "那今天我会是这个环节的主持人。"}, {"id": "V65.4", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null, "speaker": "2", "speaker_name": null, "person_ref": null, "text": "那之后我会在问每一个老师这个专门的问题是针对带给老师的。"}]}
